y&rsquo;s 6 grids in Marion County shows January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, August to September ran 34% of normal on the middle of the grids, and January to February ran 28%. Grid 23853 had its driest year in 1988 at 51% of normal. On grid 23553, July to August 2026 is a preliminary estimate at 69.6, from NOAA rain and not the final index.</p>"}
